{#
| Variable            | Type   | Description                            |
|---------------------|--------|----------------------------------------|
| page                | object |                                        |
| page.title          | string |                                        |
| page.slug           | string |                                        |
| order               | Order  | @see pages/customer/orders/single.twig |
| thank_you_title     | string | merchant customized main text          |
| share_message       | string |                                        |
| short_share_message | string |                                        |

Fulfilment section is picked from order state:
 - pickup (order.is_pickable)  -> <salla-order-branch items sticky-cta> (items card + branch details footer)
 - delivery (single or split)  -> <salla-order-shipments sticky-cta> (one card per shipment, bottom sheet for split)
Digital orders are out of scope here (they are redirected to the order summary page by the backend).

The fulfilment CTA lives inside those components: on desktop it renders in-flow above the cards
(as in the design), on mobile it is the sticky bottom bar.
#}
{% extends "layouts.master" %}

{% block content %}

    {# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
       LINK TEST — temporary. The real page is disabled below with
       {% if false %} rather than a Twig comment, because the page already
       contains nine of them and Twig comments do not nest.
       Revert this commit once the submodule + CDN wiring is confirmed.
    #}
    <div style="padding:80px 20px;text-align:center;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif">
        <h1 style="font-size:28px;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 12px">theme-raed is linked ✅</h1>
        <p style="font-size:16px;color:#666;margin:0">
            thank-you.twig from <code>feature/OD-8789-thank-you-page</code> is being served.
        </p>
    </div>

    {% if false %}
    {% hook 'thank-you:start' %}
    <div class="container">
        <div class="mx-auto flex w-full max-w-[800px] flex-col gap-6 py-8">
        {# Header + fulfilment + payment share the design's 12px rhythm #}
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
            {# Header: merchant main/subtext (Header Customization story), order number, date & time #}
            <header class="flex w-full flex-col items-center gap-3 text-center">
                <div class="flex w-full flex-col items-center gap-1">
                    <span class="thanks-item opacity-0 relative flex items-center justify-center w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-primary text-primary-reverse">
                        <i class="sicon-check text-[28px]"></i>
                        <span class="absolute bottom-px rtl:right-px ltr:left-px flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-white text-primary">
                            {% if store.logo %}
                                <img src="{{ store.logo|cdn(48, 48) }}" alt="{{ store.name }}" class="w-full h-full object-contain" loading="lazy">
                            {% else %}
                                <i class="sicon-store text-xs"></i>
                            {% endif %}
                        </span>
                    </span>
                    <h1 data-testid="store-thankyou-title" class="thanks-item opacity-0 m-0 text-xl font-bold leading-7 text-[#333]">{{ thank_you_title }}</h1>
                    <p class="thanks-item opacity-0 m-0 w-full text-sm leading-5 text-[#666]">{{ thank_you_subtitle ?? trans('pages.thank_you.order_received') }}</p>
                </div>

                <hr class="thanks-item opacity-0 w-full border-0 border-t border-[#f4f4f4]">

                <div class="thanks-item opacity-0 flex w-full flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-x-6 gap-y-1 text-xs leading-4 text-[#666]">
                    <button type="button" data-testid="store-thankyou-order-id" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1"
                            onclick="app.copyToClipboard(event)" data-content="{{ order.reference_id }}">
                        <i class="sicon-page-check pointer-events-none text-[14px]"></i>
                        <span class="pointer-events-none" dir="ltr">#{{ order.reference_id }}</span>
                        <i class="copy-icon sicon-pages pointer-events-none text-[14px]"></i>
                    </button>
                    <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1">
                        <i class="sicon-clock text-[14px]"></i>
                        <span>{{ order.created_at|date('Y/m/d - h:i A')|number }}</span>
                    </span>
                </div>

                {% if order.instructions %}
                    <article class="article article--main article--small text-center">{{ order.instructions|raw }}</article>
                {% endif %}
                {% for message in messages %}
                    <span class="font-bold">{{ message }}</span>
                {% endfor %}
            </header>

            {# Items list + tracking / pickup info #}
            {% hook 'thank-you:items.start' %}
            {% if order.is_pickable %}
                <salla-order-branch data-testid="store-thankyou-branch" items="{{ order.items|json_encode }}" sticky-cta></salla-order-branch>
            {% else %}
                <salla-order-shipments data-testid="store-thankyou-shipments" class="empty:hidden" sticky-cta></salla-order-shipments>
            {% endif %}
            {% hook 'thank-you:items.end' %}

            {# Payment #}
            <section data-testid="store-thankyou-payment" class="flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-3 rounded-lg border border-[#f4f4f4] bg-white p-[11px]">
                <dl class="flex w-full flex-col gap-2">
                    <div class="flex w-full items-center gap-4">
                        <dt class="flex-1 text-start text-xs leading-4 text-[#666]">{{ trans('pages.cart.payment_way') }}</dt>
                        <dd class="m-0 flex items-center">
                            <img src="{{ ('images/payment/' ~ order.payment_method ~ '_mini.png')|cdn(58, 58) }}" alt="{{ order.payment_method }}" class="h-4 w-auto" loading="lazy" onerror="this.remove()">
                        </dd>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex w-full items-start gap-4">
                        <dt class="flex-1 text-start text-xs leading-4 text-[#666]">{{ trans('pages.cart.items_total') }}</dt>
                        <dd class="m-0 text-xs leading-4 text-[#666]">{{ order.sub_total|money }}</dd>
                    </div>
                    {% if order.tax %}
                        <div class="flex w-full items-start gap-4">
                            <dt class="flex-1 text-start text-xs leading-4 text-[#666]">{{ trans('pages.cart.tax') }}</dt>
                            <dd class="m-0 text-xs leading-4 text-[#666]">{{ order.tax.amount|money }}</dd>
                        </div>
                    {% endif %}
                    {% if order.shipping_cost %}
                        <div class="flex w-full items-start gap-4">
                            <dt class="flex-1 text-start text-xs leading-4 text-[#666]">{{ trans('pages.orders.shipping_cost') }}</dt>
                            <dd class="m-0 text-xs leading-4 text-[#666]">{{ order.shipping_cost|money }}</dd>
                        </div>
                    {% endif %}
                    <div class="flex w-full items-start gap-4">
                        <dt class="flex-1 text-start text-sm font-bold leading-5 text-[#333]">{{ trans('pages.orders.final_total') }}</dt>
                        <dd class="m-0 text-sm font-bold leading-5 text-[#333]">{{ order.total|money }}</dd>
                    </div>
                </dl>
                <button type="button" data-testid="store-thankyou-order-details-btn"
                        class="flex h-10 w-full items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-lg border border-[#eee] text-sm font-bold text-primary"
                        onclick="salla.order.show({order_id:'{{ order.id }}', url:'{{ order.url }}'})">
                    <i class="sicon-receipt text-base leading-none"></i>
                    {{ trans('pages.thank_you.view_invoice') }}
                </button>
            </section>
        </div>

        {# Merchant custom component after the payment section (Custom Component story) #}
        {% hook 'thank-you:payment.end' %}

        {#
          Rewards earned on this order (cashback + loyalty points).
          NOTE: the thank-you contract does not expose these yet, so the markup below assumes
            order.cashback       -> { amount: Money, url: string }
            order.loyalty_points -> int (links to the loyalty page)
          Each tile stays hidden until the backend sends it; rename the guards once the
          Loyalty & Cashback Settings story lands.
        #}
        {% if order.cashback or order.loyalty_points %}
            <div data-testid="store-thankyou-rewards" class="flex w-full flex-wrap items-stretch gap-2">
                {% if order.loyalty_points %}
                    <a href="{{ link('loyalty') }}"
                       class="flex flex-1 min-w-[220px] items-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-[#effbf6] px-4 py-3 no-underline">
                        <span class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 items-center gap-2">
                            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-6 w-6 shrink-0 fill-current text-[#008c56]" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M12 21.744C11.808 21.744 11.64 21.672 11.496 21.528C11.352 21.384 11.28 21.208 11.28 21C11.28 19.672 10.888 18.352 10.104 17.04C9.336 15.792 8.352 14.776 7.152 13.992C5.904 13.16 4.64 12.744 3.36 12.744C3.168 12.744 3 12.672 2.856 12.528C2.712 12.384 2.64 12.208 2.64 12C2.64 11.792 2.712 11.616 2.856 11.472C3 11.328 3.168 11.256 3.36 11.256C4.64 11.256 5.904 10.84 7.152 10.008C8.352 9.224 9.336 8.208 10.104 6.96C10.888 5.648 11.28 4.328 11.28 3C11.28 2.792 11.352 2.616 11.496 2.472C11.64 2.328 11.808 2.256 12 2.256C12.192 2.256 12.36 2.328 12.504 2.472C12.648 2.616 12.72 2.792 12.72 3C12.72 4.328 13.112 5.648 13.896 6.96C14.664 8.208 15.648 9.224 16.848 10.008C18.096 10.84 19.36 11.256 20.64 11.256C20.832 11.256 21 11.328 21.144 11.472C21.288 11.616 21.36 11.792 21.36 12C21.36 12.208 21.288 12.384 21.144 12.528C21 12.672 20.832 12.744 20.64 12.744C19.36 12.744 18.096 13.16 16.848 13.992C15.648 14.776 14.664 15.792 13.896 17.04C13.112 18.352 12.72 19.672 12.72 21C12.72 21.208 12.648 21.384 12.504 21.528C12.36 21.672 12.192 21.744 12 21.744ZM6.648 12C7.8 12.528 8.852 13.288 9.804 14.28C10.756 15.272 11.488 16.376 12 17.592C12.512 16.376 13.24 15.272 14.184 14.28C15.128 13.288 16.184 12.528 17.352 12C16.184 11.472 15.128 10.712 14.184 9.72C13.24 8.728 12.512 7.624 12 6.408C11.488 7.624 10.76 8.728 9.816 9.72C8.872 10.712 7.816 11.472 6.648 12ZM18 7.992C18 7.896 17.928 7.736 17.784 7.512C17.624 7.224 17.408 6.936 17.136 6.648C16.864 6.36 16.592 6.128 16.32 5.952C16.096 5.824 15.936 5.76 15.84 5.76C15.648 5.76 15.48 5.684 15.336 5.532C15.192 5.38 15.12 5.2 15.12 4.992C15.12 4.784 15.192 4.608 15.336 4.464C15.48 4.32 15.648 4.248 15.84 4.248C15.936 4.248 16.096 4.176 16.32 4.032C16.592 3.856 16.864 3.624 17.136 3.336C17.408 3.048 17.624 2.768 17.784 2.496C17.928 2.256 18 2.088 18 1.992C18 1.784 18.072 1.608 18.216 1.464C18